# Simple Python QR Generator

This is a fast and simple script to generate QR codes using Python. 

## Tools (L-adawat)
* Python
* `qrcode` library

## How it works (Kifach kiy-khdem)
When you run the `QR_code.py` script, it converts the URL into a QR code and saves it as an image file (`insta_qr.png`).